    "title": "Man accused of killing Idaho inmate in Arizona prison was serving time for Rexburg murder - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Deseret Digital Media ,\n1 days ago ELOY, Arizona — An inmate accused of killing an Idaho prisoner in Arizona last month was incarcerated for murdering a Rexburg man and attempting to kill the man's wife. Multiple sources tell EastIdahoNews.com that the suspect in the Arizona prison murder is Pierre Lake, a 22-year-old from Rigby who is serving a sentence of 30 years to life after pleading guilty to the first-degree murder of Ralph Brian. He also pleaded guilty to the attempted murder of Karen Brian, Ralph Brian's wife. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
